===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic|colloquial}} A [[person]] who [[dress]]es in the [[clothes]] of another [[sex]], or in clothes which make their [[gender identity]] [[ambiguous]].
# {{lb|en|by extension}} An [[event]] where people are [[encourage]]d to [[dress]] in the [[clothes]] of another [[sex]], even if they would normally not.
# {{lb|en|fantasy}} A [[person]] [[capable]] of [[change|changing]] their [[physical]] [[sex]].
# {{lb|en|fantasy}} An instance of someone's [[physical]] [[sex]] being [[change]]d, usually via [[magic]].

